    "en": "Nei-chan adds: “His ghost is terrified of bodily death and the severance of gene—terrified that ‘you’ as a subject will vanish. That seems to be the core of his bug.”",
    "ja": "Kaedeがセキュリティレールを敷設する。彼女の動きは、救急医のそれ——迅速で、確実。"
